! CORGPIPE with N_BINS set and CORGPLATES with TMAX set, so neither needs the s range; only centroid and sigma
! output, whose sums (and the wakes' bunch means) the device makes in its own order. Rounding expected.
C: CHARGE, TOTAL=1e-9
D: DRIF, L=0.5
CP: CORGPIPE, L=1.33, RADIUS=3e-3, DEPTH=450e-6, PERIOD=1e-3, GAP=750e-6, N_BINS=400
CPL: CORGPLATES, L=1.0, HALFGAP=2e-3, PERIOD=0.5e-3, DEPTH=0.5e-3, TMAX=2e-13
BL: LINE=(C, D, CP, D, CPL, D)
